{"title":"The Emberfang's Heart","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Emberfang&#39;s Heart is a named <a href=\"#/monster/emberfang-heart\">Emberfang&#39;s Heart</a> seen at level 65–69.</p>\n      \n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Emberfang&#39;s Heart</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>The Molten Heart</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 14×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"6305\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-emberfang-s-heart\">Show on map</button>\n      \n      <h2>Drops</h2><div class=\"collector-extra\"><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gold-coin\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/2216cc0344c9d30bb3ee.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gold Coin</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">4 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"ember-core\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/f51fcc7dea071d81fbeb.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ember Core</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">3 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"lizper-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/32c045dadd9ca37ea76c.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Lizper Feet</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip dropicon-link\" data-item=\"gem-ruby\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/c3be065d1945333c2808.svg\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Gem Ruby</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">2 drops</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+7 more\">+7 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra dropicon-link\" data-item=\"thorn-feet\"><img class=\"thumb itemthumb\" src=\"data/img/gen/c545c7eb5d27184e604